// door_helper: spring door learned: hold it yourself.
// The pass failed (the door shut: a spring door) and wrote the type: the replan takes the next method.
// method: behave
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !unlatch r1 d1
//   2. !hold_door r1 d1
//   3. !pass_door r1 d1 room_a
//   4. !release_door r1 d1
//   5. &fetch r1 box hall

self r1
robot r1
robot r2
door d1 hall room_a
door d1 room_a hall
route hall room_a room_a
route hall room_b room_a
route room_a hall hall
route room_a room_b room_b
route room_b room_a room_a
route room_b hall room_a
job fetch box hall
status r1 free
status r2 free
at r1 hall
at r2 room_b
object_at box room_b
door_type d1 spring
